/caption><graphic xlink:href="jksc-27-180-g001"/></fig><fig id="F2" position="float"><label>Fig. 2</label><caption><p>(A) Hypoganglinosis and aggregated abnormal ganglions in the myenteric plexus (H&#x00026;E, &#x000d7; 400). (B) Thickened proper muscle and hypoganglinosis in the myenteric plexus (H&#x00026;E, &#x000d7; 400).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jksc-27-180-g002"/></fig><fig id="F3" position="float"><label>Fig. 3</label><caption><p>Change of Wexner's constipation scores for the preoperative and the postoperative periods (total).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jksc-27-180-g003"/></fig><table-wrap id="T1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Diagnostic criteria<sup>a</sup> of functional constipation (Rome III)</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jksc-27-180-i001"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p><sup>a</sup>Criteria fulfilled for the last 3 months with symptom onset at least 6 months prior to the diagnosis.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Wexner constipation score</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jksc-27-180-i002"/></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>Clinical characteristics</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jksc-27-180-i003"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p><sup>a</sup>Values in parenthesis are range. <sup>b</sup>Values are presented as mean &#x000b1; standard deviation.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T4" position="float"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p>Segmental colonic transit time</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jksc-27-180-i004"/></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T5" position="float"><label>Table 5</label><caption><p>Findings of preoperative manometry</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jksc-27-180-i005"/></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T6" position="float"><label>Table 6</label><caption><p>Postoperative complications &#x00026; management</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jksc-27-180-i006"/><table-wrap-foot>